# Task 13 — Integrate grounding into invoke() orchestration
# Executed: 2026-07-16T15:30Z
# Base commit: 427304f

## Changes
- services/ai-invoker/src/index.ts: invoke() now integrates the full grounding flow:
  - Imports runGroundingFlow, emitGroundingBlockedAndHonestMiss, GROUNDING_RETRY_INSTRUCTION
  - After converse(): if groundingContext present → runGroundingFlow()
  - On block (flagged=true): retry once with GROUNDING_RETRY_INSTRUCTION + source injection
  - On double-fail: emitGroundingBlockedAndHonestMiss → honest-miss template returned
  - On pass-after-retry: flagged=true in evidence (passed on second attempt)
  - On first-pass: flagged=false with scores + citations
  - guardrailEvidence attached to InvokeResponse
  - L4-5: temperature capped at 0.3 for feature='record-write'
  - Dormant when groundingContext absent (no-op path)
- services/ai-invoker/__tests__/invoke-grounding.test.ts: NEW — 5 integration tests
  - Dormant path (no groundingContext → no grounding check)
  - ACC-1 path (grounding passes → evidence present, flagged=false)
  - Retry path (block→retry→pass: flagged=true, uses retry text)
  - ACC-2 path (double-fail → honest-miss template + Ai.GroundingBlocked event)
  - L4-5 temperature enforcement for record-write

